WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:04.550
Have you ever wondered what&nbsp;
SCP-1881, the Arcade Machine, wants?

00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:08.870
Foundation staff snapped a picture&nbsp;
of SCP-1881 while it was standing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.870 --> 00:00:13.850
in its store room, using SCP-978, the&nbsp;
Desire Camera, and this was the result:

00:00:13.850 --> 00:00:17.930
"SCP-1881 is surrounded by numerous children of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:22.370
various ages and genders and all of them&nbsp;
appear to have quarters in their hands."

00:00:22.370 --> 00:00:27.050
This result indicates a surprising degree of&nbsp;
sentience on the part of the Arcade Machine,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:30.470
and an apparent desire to&nbsp;
serve its intended purpose.

